<span id="S4.Thmtheorem1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">In particular <math id="S4.Thmtheorem1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g_{\eta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>η</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g_{\eta}</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="S4.Thmtheorem1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math>-Lipschitz.</span>